    <section class="bg-light py-5">
        <h1 class="fw-bold text-center text-dark text-uppercase bebas">Calidad y Experiencia</h1>
        <div class="mostache-hr hr-black my-3">
            <div class="mostache-hr-inner"></div>
            <img src="/images/icons/mostacho.png" alt="moustache">
            <div class="mostache-hr-inner"></div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-center text-dark">High Quality Barber se dedica a brindarles a nuestros clientes un excelente corte de cabello y un servicio premium a un precio asequible.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="bg-image-wood py-5 position-relative">
        <div class="backdrop-image" style="z-index: 1;"></div>
        
        <div class="position-relative py-4" style="z-index: 2;">
            <h1 class="fw-bold text-center">Servicios</h1>
            <div class="mostache-hr hr-light my-4">
                <div class="mostache-hr-inner"></div>
                <img src="/images/icons/mostacho.png" alt="moustache">
